    "detailed_description": "<strong>PolarUP </strong>is a punishing climbing game. So you simply have to get to the finish by using your magnet powers.<br><br><strong>Main mechanic</strong><br>As you may know magnets have 2 polarities. Negative and positive.<br>If you try to connect similar polarities, some magical force wouldn\u2019t allow you to do it. But opposite polarities are attracted to each other. <br>So the main tool that would help you complete the game would be a <i>Magnet Gun</i>.<br><br>By combining right polarity of the <i>Magnet Gun</i> and positive or negative charged platforms you attract/repel yourself to/from platform to overcome obstacles and get to the end. <br>But be careful! One wrong decision can cancel your progress and you have to start over again.",
